<title>UK: SNCF sets 2.0 bln FRF 11-year TEC 10-linked FRN.</title>
<headline>SNCF sets 2.0 bln FRF 11-year TEC 10-linked FRN.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-09-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following domestic floating-rate issue was announced by joint lead managers Credit Lyonnais, CIC and Morgan Stanley.</p>
<p> BORROWER   SOCIETE NATIONALE DES CHEMINS DE FER FRANCAIS</p>
<p> AMT    2.0 BLN FRF   SPREAD     -105 BP   MATURITY    14.OCT.07</p>
<p> TYPE	 FRN	 BASE	 TEC 10    PAY DATE    14.OCT.96</p>
<p> LAST MOODY AAA	 ISS PRICE  100.89    FULL FEES   1.30</p>
<p> LAST S&amp;P   AAA	 REOFFER    99.94</p>
<p> LISTING    PARIS     DENOMS (K) 5	   SALE LIMITS =</p>
<p> MGT/UND    0.10/0.45 SELL CONC  0.75	PRAECIPUUM  NONE</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
